    (uuid "eb82989a-df36-46df-bf6a-69da2a1f5e13")
  )
  (text "No input bulk added: upstream capacitance/source-impedance budget remains open.\nInput ceramics require >=2.2uF aggregate effective through 35V.\nPWR_FLAGs represent external input/return and actual passively filtered buck output."
    (at 25.4 146.05 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "c7067f7b-2c28-47b7-a19c-c9927acff3a4")
  )
  (text "VIN min operating4.3V; UVLO rise max4.25V, fall3.8V typ.\nWeak-source chatter/restart is unresolved; no independent UV supervisor.\nNo MCU action is required to start essential power."
    (at 25.4 185.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cf76f4ba-4012-49c4-a51c-a83c2c44b4f8")
  )
  (text "STATIC SETPOINT: 31.6k / 10.2k, 0.1%, 25ppm/K.\nNominal3.278V; reference+tolerance+temperature range in calculation.\nCFF omitted per TI Table8-2; check full selected LC/real load."
    (at 241.3 162.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "747917ce-2fc9-479d-9328-ecd8e0ee9383")
  )
  (text "OPEN FAULT CONTAINMENT: a failed-short high-side switch can expose +3V3\nconsumers and 25V output bank to ~35V. Autonomous 3V3 OV isolation is not present.\nUpstream solar OV protection does not protect the 3V3 rail from this failure."
    (at 25.4 219.71 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "cc917843-d38d-4e5c-96fe-4c4da7b856f8")
  )
  (text "POLICY OPEN: S03 native severity persistence and S11 visible rating-field styling unavailable.\nExisting custom U1 reused; original S08 review-marker coverage unresolved. No PCB work."
    (at 25.4 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e3acac74-5b72-4503-9f43-763fd3031f20")
  )
